            "ratingValue": 5,
            "bestRating": 5,
            "worstRating": 1
        },
        "reviewBody": "We used Suntransfers from Tenerife South Airport to our hotel and on the return trip too. \nThe booking process was straight forward. All the relevant information was provided. \nThe airport desk was easy to find and our driver was there waiting for us. \nOn the way home, we were collected on time. \nGreat service from start to finish!\nCan\u2019t fault this company and will definitely use them again! ",
