        {"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","name":"Nomador","url":"https:\/\/www.nomador.com\/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/www.nomador.com\/static\/logo-nomador-512.png","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.nomador.com\/static\/logo-nomador-512.png","width":512,"height":512},"sameAs":["https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/nomador.community","https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/nomador_com\/","https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/Nomador\/","https:\/\/www.trustpilot.com\/review\/www.nomador.com"]},{"@type":"WebSite","name":"Nomador","url":"https:\/\/www.nomador.com\/"}]}
    ", "
    {"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Nomador?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Nomador is a community platform that connects Hosts \u2014 pet owners looking for pet care \u2014 with Sitters, to arrange care for both pets and home during an absence.<\/p>\n<p>The idea is simple: a member of the community comes to look after the animals and the home, in exchange for accommodation.<\/p>\n<p>Beyond the concept, Nomador is built on strong values: <strong>trust<\/strong>, <strong>sharing<\/strong>, and <strong>a love of animals<\/strong>. Connections develop at your own pace, thanks to detailed profiles, recommendations, and reviews left after each stay.<\/p>\n<p>With members across the globe, the Nomador community makes it possible to arrange pet sitting and meet new people anywhere in the world, in a reassuring and transparent setting.<\/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does pet sitting work on Nomador?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>It works in four steps:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>The Host publishes a advert<\/strong> with their dates away, a description of their home, their pets, and what they're looking for.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Sitters get in touch<\/strong> to express their interest, introduce themselves, and discuss the stay.<\/li>\n<li><strong>The Host chooses<\/strong> the person they feel most comfortable with, based on their profile, reviews, and a direct conversation.<\/li>\n<li><strong>The stay takes place<\/strong>: the Sitter moves in and takes care of the home and animals, while the Host travels with peace of mind.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>At the end of the stay, both parties leave a review to enrich the community.<\/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are pet sittings paid?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p><strong>No, pet sittings are not paid.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Nomador is based on a peer-to-peer service exchange: the Sitter is hosted free of charge and takes care of the animals and the home during the Host's absence. In return, the Host benefits from a free, ideal pet care solution to look after their companions day-to-day and keep their home secure.<\/p>\n<p>This model fosters relationships built on trust, mutual support, and a love of animals.<\/p>\n<p>Only the Nomador subscription is paid. It gives you access to the platform and provides a framework for exchanges within the community.<\/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Nomador work in my country?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Yes. Nomador is an <strong>international<\/strong> platform, used by members around the world. Whether you'd like to have your pets looked after at home in France, or sit a cat in Tokyo, a dog in Lisbon, or donkeys in Vermont \u2014 it's all possible. The community is active on every continent.<\/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I connect with confidence on Nomador?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Trust is at the heart of Nomador. Several mechanisms are in place:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Verified profiles<\/strong>: every member can have their identity verified.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Two-way reviews<\/strong>: after each stay, Hosts and Sitters share their experience through a system of badges and recommendations.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Trust profiles<\/strong>: a profile builds up and strengthens over time as members engage with the community, making it easy to spot the most experienced members at a glance.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Pre-stay conversation<\/strong>: before each stay, a direct exchange (message, video call, or in-person meeting) is strongly encouraged. These conversations let you check the essentials and confirm that your expectations are aligned. <strong>You always remain free to choose the member you feel fully comfortable with.<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get started on Nomador?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>It's quick:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Sign up for free<\/strong> and complete your profile (photo, bio, interests\u2026).<\/li>\n<li><strong>Have your identity verified<\/strong> to build trust from the start.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Publish your first advert<\/strong> (Host) or <strong>browse available stays<\/strong> (Sitter).<\/li>\n<li><strong>Connect with members<\/strong>, find your stay or your Sitter, and get started!<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n"}}]}
"]

