["{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/","url":"https://www.skisolutions.com/","name":"Ski Holidays 2026/2027 | The Ski Experts","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#website"},"about":{"@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#organization"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#primaryimage"},"image":{"@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https://image.skisolutions.com/2023/05/05152606/Hero-3-new.jpg","datePublished":"2023-03-04T09:54:36+00:00","dateModified":"2026-10-16T10:53:12+00:00","description":"Ski holidays to the finest ski resorts. The experts in skiing and snowboarding holidays. Find the best ski deals and ski packages with ABTA and ATOL protection.","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#breadcrumb"},"inLanguage":"en-GB","potentialAction":[{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["https://www.skisolutions.com/"]}]},{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-GB","@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#primaryimage","url":"https://image.skisolutions.com/2023/05/05152606/Hero-3-new.jpg","contentUrl":"https://image.skisolutions.com/2023/05/05152606/Hero-3-new.jpg","width":1903,"height":696,"caption":"A skier in powder snow in front of a mountain range"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home"}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#website","url":"https://www.skisolutions.com/","name":"Ski Solutions","description":"Ski holidays to the finest ski resorts. The experts in skiing and snowboarding holidays.","publisher":{"@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#organization"},"potentialAction":[{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https://www.skisolutions.com/?s={search_term_string}"},"query-input":{"@type":"PropertyValueSpecification","valueRequired":true,"valueName":"search_term_string"}}],"inLanguage":"en-GB"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#organization","name":"SKI SOLUTIONS LIMITED","alternateName":"Ski Solutions, SkiSolutions","url":"https://www.skisolutions.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-GB","@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#/schema/logo/image/","url":"https://image.skisolutions.com/2026/07/13095117/cropped-ski-solutions-favicon.webp","contentUrl":"https://image.skisolutions.com/2026/07/13095117/cropped-ski-solutions-favicon.webp","width":512,"height":512,"caption":"SKI SOLUTIONS LIMITED"},"image":{"@id":"https://www.skisolutions.com/#/schema/logo/image/"},"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/skisolutions/","https://x.com/skisolutions"]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Product","name":"Ski Solutions","description":"Ski holidays to the finest ski resorts. The experts in skiing and snowboarding holidays. Find the best ski deals and ski packages with ABTA and ATOL protection.","aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":4.8,"ratingCount":1019},"brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Ski Solutions"}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TravelAgency","name":"Ski Solutions","url":"https://www.skisolutions.com","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Unit 3 Walton Lodge Laundry 374 Coldharbour Lane","addressLocality":"London","postalCode":"SW9 8PL","addressCountry":"GB"},"openingHours":["Mo-Fr 00:00-00:00","Sa 09:00-17:00","Su 11:00-16:00"],"companyRegistration":{"@type":"Certification","name":"Companies House","identifier":"01876045"},"award":["British Travel Awards 2024: Best Travel Company for Ski/Winter Sports Holidays","Feefo 2025: Platinum Trusted Service Award"]}]}", "
    {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Where is the best place to go on a skiing holiday?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "We offer ski breaks to a wealth of popular destinations, such as France, Italy, Austria, Norway, Andorra, Switzerland, Canada and the USA, but your chosen resort will depend on a variety of factors. These might include your skiing or snowboarding ability and experience, who you&#8217;re travelling with, the type of holiday you want, and the time of year. If you&#8217;re unsure what the best resort for you is, our ski experts can offer information and advice on the destinations that meet your requirements. "
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "When is the best time to go on a ski trip?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Winter ski holidays are typically the most popular, with December, January and February offering snow-sure conditions in many resorts across Europe and North America. These months also tend to be the coldest and have the highest chance of fresh snow, especially in high-altitude resorts. Spring is also a great time for a ski holiday, with blue skies and sunshine providing some magnificent views of the breathtaking mountain scenery. "
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What type of accommodation is there on a ski package holiday?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "We offer a variety of accommodation, including chalets, hotels and luxury apartments, so you&#8217;re sure to discover the right fit for your group. With self-catering, all-inclusive and gourmet dining experiences available, you&#8217;ll find plenty of choice across all the resorts. If you&#8217;re unsure what type of accommodation might suit you best, speak to our expert team and we can recommend some great options. "
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Are your ski holidays suitable for beginners?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Absolutely! Our ski package holidays are suitable for all levels and abilities. Some resorts are more equipped for beginners than others and feature an excellent selection of green and blue runs – perfect for if you&#8217;re just starting out. We can help you identify the ideal resorts for beginners. "
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do you offer ski holidays for advanced skiers?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Our selection of ski holidays includes some outstanding resorts that cater to more advanced skiers or snowboarders. If you&#8217;re looking for fresh powder, challenging black runs and a wealth of off-piste opportunities, there are plenty of destinations to choose from. Of course, if you&#8217;re travelling with a group of mixed abilities, you&#8217;ll want a location that caters for everyone, such as Val Thorens in France or Obergurgl in Austria. "
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Can you arrange lift passes and ski lessons?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Our Client Services team are on hand to organise lift passes, equipment and lessons, meaning you can just relax and focus on skiing the mountains. "
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do I need to take my own equipment on a ski holiday?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "All equipment can be pre-booked in advance, so there&#8217;s no need to worry about extra baggage on your ski holiday. Our team can help you arrange exactly what you need. If you&#8217;d rather use your own skis or snowboard, that&#8217;s fine too! "
            }
        },
        {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Can I enjoy other activities on a skiing trip?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Our extensive range of resorts offer a wealth of activities alongside the main skiing and snowboarding facilities. If you&#8217;re travelling with family, we can advise you on destinations that provide entertainment for young children, such as tobogganing and ice skating. Many resorts feature exceptional dining opportunities, including Michelin-starred restaurants, for a luxury evening meal. If your focus is on après ski, we can recommend locations that offer lively nightlife in the form of rustic bars, traditional pubs and clubs. "
        "]

